# Pairs with OriginAuthenticated. A method's own check runs without the
# interceptor's verdict, so an unaccepted credential reaches the verb.
MODULE: ReceiverInterceptorBypassed
TARGET: OriginAuthenticated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the host serves a call whatever the shared-secret interceptor decided
PERTURBS: Call

--- FIND
        status == IF gate # "pass" THEN gate ELSE verb[1]
--- REPLACE
        status == verb[1]
--- END